WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:03.163
- It could either feel
elegant or like a porn star.

00:00:03.163 --> 00:00:06.832
(lively whimsical music)

00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:09.089
- I'm not gonna lie to you,
I'm kind of scared of this.

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:11.596
- Is this really what my
fingernail would feel like,

00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:13.120
if it was isolated?

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.272
- Got my nails lined up.

00:00:15.272 --> 00:00:17.649
- And I have to hold it for a bit,

00:00:17.649 --> 00:00:19.207
or just ... ?

00:00:19.207 --> 00:00:20.082
- [Voiceover] Did you read

00:00:20.082 --> 00:00:21.342
the instructions?
- [Young man] No.

00:00:21.342 --> 00:00:22.959
- Okay. I glued myself to myself.

00:00:22.959 --> 00:00:24.687
- It's one of these
moments where you realize

00:00:24.687 --> 00:00:26.271
that, like, "Oh, I use my thumbs a lot."

00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:27.632
- Ooh, that one kind of hurts.

00:00:27.632 --> 00:00:30.388
It, like, kinda digs into my
skin, but it looks better.

00:00:30.388 --> 00:00:31.400
Beauty is pain.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.712
- Oh, it's hard to do stuff already.

00:00:33.712 --> 00:00:35.013
It's kind of like a talon.

00:00:35.013 --> 00:00:38.730
- I feel a lot less in control
of my hands and my fingers.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.539
- Like, this is what
Gollum would look like

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:41.919
building a model airplane.

00:00:41.919 --> 00:00:43.258
- Got it.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.790
- Ooh, I could seduce a
younger man right now.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.422
- Kind of feel like a little
bit like Edward Scissorhands.

00:00:49.422 --> 00:00:51.006
A little bit, you know, like maybe I could

00:00:51.006 --> 00:00:53.111
go around to bushes and just, like ...

00:00:53.111 --> 00:00:54.451
- This is one of those things where,

00:00:54.451 --> 00:00:57.215
if life is gonna be much
more difficult with these

00:00:57.215 --> 00:01:00.585
than without these, then
I really don't get these.

00:01:02.753 --> 00:01:05.739
- Okay. This is hard. I'm trying
to get it out of my pocket.

00:01:05.739 --> 00:01:07.466
- Putting these on, I
don't wanna break them.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:10.006
- Damn! It would be hard
to text your grandson.

00:01:10.006 --> 00:01:11.875
- I usually press my buttons like this.

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:13.217
And now I have to go like that.

00:01:13.217 --> 00:01:15.288
- I like using, like, my
swipe feature on this.

00:01:15.288 --> 00:01:17.103
It's way too hard to use swipe.

00:01:17.103 --> 00:01:19.782
And it's even harder to,
like, delete, delete stuff,

00:01:19.782 --> 00:01:22.375
because my initial instinct is
to just type it with my nail.

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:24.098
- All right. I'm getting
better, better at it.

00:01:24.098 --> 00:01:26.800
But I definitely have to
adjust how I do everything.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.897
- I'll text my mom.

00:01:27.897 --> 00:01:29.838
Gonna try and gonna take
a little selfie here.

00:01:29.838 --> 00:01:30.803
(camera shutter clicks)

00:01:30.803 --> 00:01:34.013
- These nails say, "I
really like to Instagram."

00:01:34.013 --> 00:01:36.106
- Let's do a selfie.
(camera shutter clicks)

00:01:36.106 --> 00:01:38.605
- Okay, this is, this is just difficult.

00:01:38.605 --> 00:01:40.981
- Hashtag -- nope, that's a percentage.

00:01:40.981 --> 00:01:44.151
- (bleep) Theory and Google Voice?

00:01:44.151 --> 00:01:46.223
That's probably for people that have this.

00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:47.992
(camera shutter clicks repeatedly)

00:01:47.992 --> 00:01:49.758
(bell rings)

00:01:49.758 --> 00:01:52.177
- It definitely makes
you feel a different way,

00:01:52.177 --> 00:01:54.622
which is a combination of,

00:01:54.622 --> 00:01:58.239
like, dainty and in control.

00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:00.027
- I feel like I'd have to go through some,

00:02:00.027 --> 00:02:03.807
like, 80s montage training to
figure out how to use these.

00:02:03.807 --> 00:02:06.548
- I like the freedom that
my fingertips give me.

00:02:06.548 --> 00:02:08.458
- I never go up to a woman and be, like,

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:10.002
"I like your nails!"

00:02:10.002 --> 00:02:11.668
- I can't be a big opponent of them.

00:02:11.668 --> 00:02:14.310
I kind of dig them. I can
see what it's all about.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.752
- My initial instinct was to say, like,

00:02:15.752 --> 00:02:17.337
"Why would you want to
grow your nails out?

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.551
"Like, that makes your life
harder, yadda, yadda, yadda."

00:02:19.551 --> 00:02:20.357
But at the same time, like,

00:02:20.357 --> 00:02:23.281
I don't wanna invalidate what you want.

00:02:23.281 --> 00:02:24.947
- Wearing new things, like, obviously

00:02:24.947 --> 00:02:26.941
makes you feel a different way.

00:02:26.941 --> 00:02:29.156
And that's, like, one of
the most interesting things

00:02:29.156 --> 00:02:31.025
I feel like I learned from, like, these,

00:02:31.025 --> 00:02:33.423
"try a fashion for the
first time" is, like,

00:02:33.423 --> 00:02:35.638
there's a specific way
that something like this

00:02:35.638 --> 00:02:38.482
makes you feel, and that's
kinda the fun behind it

00:02:38.482 --> 00:02:40.980
and that's kinda the fun
behind fashion in general.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.446
(swoosh, hinge creaks)

